{
  "quotes": [
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p001-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p001",
      "start": 181,
      "end": 199,
      "surface": "「處仲若當世，心懷剛忍，非令終也。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "457f2b770e9e7407d045cc4cd977ad3a45c663eebbce6b65db8e2ab48f2bcc36",
      "speaker_role": "dao",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p001-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p001",
      "start": 210,
      "end": 237,
      "surface": "「處仲蜂目已露，但豺聲未振，若不噬人，亦當為人所噬。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "457f2b770e9e7407d045cc4cd977ad3a45c663eebbce6b65db8e2ab48f2bcc36",
      "speaker_role": "pantao",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p002-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p002",
      "start": 162,
      "end": 197,
      "surface": "「今威權悉在太傅，而選用表情，尚書猶以舊制裁之，太傅今至，必有誅罰。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c9e4ccf513ed1112dcb5787d899299930b29ae9a717fd38ac31f7ebfaf6bd059",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p002-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p002",
      "start": 228,
      "end": 251,
      "surface": "「今樹處仲于江外，使其肆豪強之心，是見賊也。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c9e4ccf513ed1112dcb5787d899299930b29ae9a717fd38ac31f7ebfaf6bd059",
      "speaker_role": "pantao",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p002-3",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p002",
      "start": 352,
      "end": 362,
      "surface": "「王與馬，共天下。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c9e4ccf513ed1112dcb5787d899299930b29ae9a717fd38ac31f7ebfaf6bd059",
      "speaker_role": null,
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "qualification": "時人合語，王與馬是家族合稱，不造單人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p008-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p008",
      "start": 267,
      "end": 281,
      "surface": "「吾與卿及茂弘當管鮑之交。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "78b9f6fe54d1d2236808ed2735e224aa6eb9ea26912f240348ef55ad5df0f094",
      "speaker_role": "yuandi",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "qualification": "王敦上疏內再引元帝舊言；內外發言者分開。"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p011-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p011",
      "start": 112,
      "end": 134,
      "surface": "「老驥伏櫪，志在千里。烈士暮年，壯心不已。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "23659202c9fd59f5c1f9fb88d769c543282dab92e3b02992d2a1cf653e2c0acc",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "quoted_author_role": "caocao",
      "qualification": "敦當時詠曹操樂府；不說曹操當場發言。"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p017-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p017",
      "start": 33,
      "end": 90,
      "surface": "「王敦憑恃寵靈，敢肆狂逆，方朕太甲，欲見幽囚。是可忍也，孰不可忍也！今親率六軍，以誅大逆，有殺敦者，封五千戶侯。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "cc4ef79a55f2e6cdcd3b77a9dc10b9df3238b9ab2a2943616a794c6ccf993881",
      "speaker_role": "yuandi",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p018-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p018",
      "start": 16,
      "end": 59,
      "surface": "「劉隗死士眾多，未易可克，不如攻石頭。周劄少恩，兵不為用，攻之必敗。劄敗，則隗自走。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "a2cbe64e11bec6030f52566f6ce8f61b8761fd5defb28f51eb34b42bcc14f935",
      "speaker_role": "duhong",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p018-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p018",
      "start": 129,
      "end": 155,
      "surface": "「欲得我處，但當早道，我自還琅邪，何至困百姓如此！」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "a2cbe64e11bec6030f52566f6ce8f61b8761fd5defb28f51eb34b42bcc14f935",
      "speaker_role": "yuandi",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p020-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p020",
      "start": 220,
      "end": 235,
      "surface": "「脫其不諱，便當以後事付應。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "f32eb2d0ae6990dc55aaf60ef27cb21d7a2721c74458189400ffeba5b9ad73f1",
      "speaker_role": "qianfeng",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p020-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p020",
      "start": 238,
      "end": 330,
      "surface": "「非常之事，豈常人所能！且應年少，安可當大事。我死之後，莫若解眾放兵，歸身朝廷，保全門戶，此計之上也。退還武昌，收兵自守，貢獻不廢，亦中計也。及吾尚存，悉眾而下，萬一僥倖，計之下也。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "f32eb2d0ae6990dc55aaf60ef27cb21d7a2721c74458189400ffeba5b9ad73f1",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p020-3",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p020",
      "start": 336,
      "end": 348,
      "surface": "「公之下計，乃上策也。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "f32eb2d0ae6990dc55aaf60ef27cb21d7a2721c74458189400ffeba5b9ad73f1",
      "speaker_role": "qianfeng",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p026-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p026",
      "start": 4,
      "end": 25,
      "surface": "「敢有舍王敦姓名而稱大將軍者，軍法從事。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "d9cb028f6a4f40b3de79f5997078635d5c037d01e5c9da3ac66d0ec47f4fc2c5",
      "speaker_role": "mingdi",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p027-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p027",
      "start": 33,
      "end": 44,
      "surface": "「此家事，吾便當行。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "868f6e535c0da054403e90b5cb31ff8c47e4d3eea9a9886a3c3b6e90d113b9e3",
      "speaker_role": "wanghan",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p027-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p027",
      "start": 58,
      "end": 70,
      "surface": "「事克之日，天子云何？」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "868f6e535c0da054403e90b5cb31ff8c47e4d3eea9a9886a3c3b6e90d113b9e3",
      "speaker_role": "qianfeng",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p027-3",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p027",
      "start": 73,
      "end": 103,
      "surface": "「尚未南郊，何得稱天子！便盡卿兵勢，保護東海王及裴妃而已。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "868f6e535c0da054403e90b5cb31ff8c47e4d3eea9a9886a3c3b6e90d113b9e3",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p033-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p033",
      "start": 29,
      "end": 65,
      "surface": "「我兄老婢耳，門戶衰矣！兄弟才兼文武者，世將、處季皆早死，今世事去矣。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "a38d1a7a10247fa00caa03856881958b21a1ec12e4f6da038aec9ef585d13c0f",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p033-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p033",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 79,
      "surface": "「我當力行。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "a38d1a7a10247fa00caa03856881958b21a1ec12e4f6da038aec9ef585d13c0f",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p034-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p034",
      "start": 34,
      "end": 59,
      "surface": "「我亡後，應便即位，先立朝廷百官，然後乃營葬事。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "31f3424222c2ebd1b5d59dde419bba6e7e48802ef21c20fb3245c978d8b00097",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p035-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p035",
      "start": 25,
      "end": 160,
      "surface": "「今舉大事，而天子已扼其喉，情離眾沮，鋒摧勢挫，持疑猶豫，必致禍敗。今若決破柵塘，因湖水灌京邑，肆舟檻之勢，極水軍之用，此所謂不戰而屈人之兵，上策也。籍初至之銳，並東南眾軍之力，十道俱進，眾寡過倍，理必摧陷，中策也。轉禍為福，因敗為成，召錢鳳計事，因斬之以降，下策也。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "e5599abd1bffe1ac9fd4d7e90fd06adbb5391c3461cd956c6b5eb74dd5ba03bc",
      "speaker_role": "guyang",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p036-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p036",
      "start": 25,
      "end": 60,
      "surface": "「王敦滔天作逆，有無君之心，宜依崔杼、王浚故事，剖棺戮屍，以彰元惡。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "557b0ea89d8aea6a1c9cb51db5a79f762e9faf625bf90d169f6c3f2b5911e653",
      "speaker_role": null,
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "qualification": "有司集體議論，非王敦或明帝第一人稱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p036-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p036",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 216,
      "surface": "「昔王莽漆頭以輗車，董卓然腹以照市，王淩儭土，徐馥焚首。前朝誅楊駿等，皆先極官刑，後聽私殯。然《春秋》許齊襄之葬紀侯，魏武義王修之哭袁譚。由斯言之，王誅加於上，私義行於下。臣以為可聽私葬，於義為弘。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "557b0ea89d8aea6a1c9cb51db5a79f762e9faf625bf90d169f6c3f2b5911e653",
      "speaker_role": "xijian",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p037-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p037",
      "start": 199,
      "end": 208,
      "surface": "「此客必能作賊。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "9a30c9aaa467ffb2f6268b3a54131c1c7ee8040de674ea00d05b76310d65260e",
      "speaker_role": null,
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "qualification": "群婢合語，不造具名作者。"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p037-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p037",
      "start": 228,
      "end": 235,
      "surface": "「此甚易耳。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "9a30c9aaa467ffb2f6268b3a54131c1c7ee8040de674ea00d05b76310d65260e",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p039-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p039",
      "start": 25,
      "end": 47,
      "surface": "「開國承家，小人勿用，佞幸在位，鮮不敗業。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "d374569507b7536763a2b099e7bc3691d35489c2ed1a869bf77987e41c3f4913",
      "speaker_role": "xiongfu",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p039-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p039",
      "start": 52,
      "end": 59,
      "surface": "「小人阿誰？」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "d374569507b7536763a2b099e7bc3691d35489c2ed1a869bf77987e41c3f4913",
      "speaker_role": "dun",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p039-3",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p039",
      "start": 78,
      "end": 112,
      "surface": "「徂風飆起蓋山陵，氛霧蔽日玉石焚。往事既去可長歎，念別惆悵復會難。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "d374569507b7536763a2b099e7bc3691d35489c2ed1a869bf77987e41c3f4913",
      "speaker_role": "xiongfu",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p040-1",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p040",
      "start": 26,
      "end": 73,
      "surface": "「三司具瞻之重，豈吾所任！幣厚言甘，古人所畏。且丈夫共事，終始當同，寧可中道改易，人誰容我！」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c61a1dfbd1c97f888170e6b0d4df79ae59d0209f3d710ac86b9a7727cad189b1",
      "speaker_role": "shenchong",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p040-2",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p040",
      "start": 76,
      "end": 217,
      "surface": "「不然。舍忠與順，未有不亡者也。大將軍阻兵不朝，爵賞自己，五尺之童知其異志。今此之舉，將行篡弑耳，豈同於往年乎？是以疆場諸將莫不歸赴本朝，內外之士咸願致死，正以移國易主，義不北面以事之也，奈何協同逆圖，當不義之責乎！朝廷坦誠，禎所知也。賊之黨類，猶宥其罪，與之更始，況見機而作邪！」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c61a1dfbd1c97f888170e6b0d4df79ae59d0209f3d710ac86b9a7727cad189b1",
      "speaker_role": "shenzhen",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p040-3",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p040",
      "start": 232,
      "end": 246,
      "surface": "「男兒不豎豹尾，終不還也。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c61a1dfbd1c97f888170e6b0d4df79ae59d0209f3d710ac86b9a7727cad189b1",
      "speaker_role": "shenchong",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p040-4",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p040",
      "start": 279,
      "end": 287,
      "surface": "「三千戶侯也。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c61a1dfbd1c97f888170e6b0d4df79ae59d0209f3d710ac86b9a7727cad189b1",
      "speaker_role": "wuru",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-jin098-p040-5",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p040",
      "start": 290,
      "end": 324,
      "surface": "「封侯不足貪也。爾以大義存我，我宗族必厚報汝。若必殺我，汝族滅矣。」",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c61a1dfbd1c97f888170e6b0d4df79ae59d0209f3d710ac86b9a7727cad189b1",
      "speaker_role": "shenchong",
      "source": "AI逐全文判讀固定範圍；非runtime NLU",
      "human_reviewed": false
    }
  ],
